COMPILATION OF: E46M18

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E46M18

   1 a 0000 E46M18:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-42/P2b] MEMBER + LITERAL + ORDINARY VARIABLE in one list,
   4 a 0006      and the QUALIFIED spelling of the same two members as items of
   5 a 0006      another list. [C253]/[C258] measure that the qualified and bare
   6 a 0006      spellings resolve to ONE cell; whether they emit the same ITEM
   7 a 0006      bytes behind an attach is what this asks. */
   8 c 0006   dcl outf file, v char(20) varying;
   9 c 0006   dcl 1 rec, 2 line char(14) varying, 2 nxt fixed bin(15);
  10 c 0006   open file(outf) stream output title('M18OUT DAT');
  11 c 0023   put file(outf) list(line,' = ',v);
  12 c 004F   put file(outf) list(rec.line,rec.nxt);
  13 c 0072   close file(outf);
  14 a 0078 end E46M18;

CODE SIZE = 007B
DATA AREA = 0033
FREE SYMS = 3863
END  COMPILATION
